[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://dw3knvxq8rtb2"]

; THE PAC-MAN ARENA. Island 0's world from golf, reshaped by ArenaField
; (data/ARENAFIELD_pacman.tres, scripts/world/SCRIPT_arena_field.gd) into a flat
; 48 x 52.8 m dirt floor centred on the origin, with forest on the three far sides
; and a thick meadow on the camera's side (+Z), grass only. The rest of the island
; is backdrop. HedgeMaze stands the classic board on the dirt in hedge blocks
; (scripts/world/SCRIPT_hedge_maze.gd, data/MAZE_classic.txt). Terrain is IslandWorld; plants are VegScatter (trees, bushes, ferns) and
; GrassScatter; sky, cloud sea, horizon band, dither and loading screen came across
; with it. None of golf's game did (wreck, pod, ruins, golf wall, pause menu).
;
; THERE IS NO LIGHT. Every material here is unshaded and computes its own sun from
; the `tod_*` shader globals TimeOfDay publishes; SunPivot only holds the direction.
;
; FlyCamera starts in the gameplay view: 100 m out to the south of the board,
; 60 degrees down at its centre, FOV 50. It still flies (WASD/QE, wheel for speed) until the game camera
; replaces it.

